# Nothing secret belongs in this repo. The Supabase anon/publishable key in
# js/config.js is public by design (it ships in client code and every table is
# protected by RLS), but the service_role key, the database password and any
# Adsterra private secret must NEVER be committed. If you ever paste one here
# by accident, rotate it in the Supabase dashboard immediately.
*.pem
*.key
id_rsa
credentials.json
service-role.json
